+coprime degree pair.  ROW-SWEEP-REVIEW uses it to kill the two `(6,3)` labels
+after approximate-root shears to `(5,3)` and `(4,3)`
+(`row-sweep-hostile-review-grok46-20260831.md:44-61`).  The coordinator
