+```text
+(u,1):       (d,n)=(gu,g),       g>=2, u>=2;
+(odd u,2):  (d,n)=(gu,2g),      g>=2, u>=3 odd;
+(4,3):      (d,n)=(4g,3g),      g>=2.
+```
+
+The next pairs beyond the reviewed `d <= 9` range are:
